--- !u!114 &1758374342
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1758374340}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c7d59935c57afa94cbf94e1dab9cb126, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BabysFirst.Rehypothecation.RehypothecationDirector
  lines:
  - id: vo_01_intro
    text: This is Farmer Brown's farm. And this is Farmer Brown's donkey, Andreas.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9a110feffd41a9347910c1442e6cdfb2, type: 3}
  - id: vo_02_problem
    text: The potatoes are ready for harvest! But Farmer Brown has no wheelbarrow. Farmer Tucker has a wheelbarrow, but no donkey. Can you take Andreas next door?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2ecf3349998ffde4f98dba965693b435, type: 3}
  - id: vo_03_collateral
    text: Good sharing! Andreas will stay with Farmer Tucker until the wheelbarrow comes home. That is called collateral.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0a9dee7e4e1538341a32674788d1be69, type: 3}
  - id: vo_04_lets_pick
    text: Now let's pick potatoes!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 599828ec965536e4998c15e8c17337af, type: 3}
  - id: vo_05_blacksmith
    text: Farmer Tucker's gate is broken. The blacksmith will fix it, if he can hold on to something nice. Farmer Tucker has something nice! It's Andreas.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5be3f564174beca498a23f59e6e18238, type: 3}
  - id: vo_06_lumberjack
    text: The blacksmith needs wood for his fire. The lumberjack would like something to hold on to. Guess what the blacksmith has!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 38176ef1d9c9d3145875ad96fa98fd9d, type: 3}
  - id: vo_07_miller
    text: The lumberjack needs flour. The miller says, is that a donkey?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a1659125fe0d764ba3b5b11f41fc203, type: 3}
  - id: vo_08_city
    text: The miller owes a man from the city. The man from the city has never seen a donkey. He writes Andreas down in a big book.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a022d1309a99d7b48a1e9688138430af, type: 3}
  - id: vo_09_count
    text: Five potatoes! Now five people are counting on one donkey.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bc181918ed65f5f47bf687d7cbe989c6, type: 3}
  - id: vo_10_paper
    text: Six potatoes! All done. Now let's go get Andreas!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0abe56843c106404fa12eebe35ef6672, type: 3}
  - id: vo_12_empty
    text: Hmm. Andreas isn't here.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 58b3210a1c93b8042950d6eef66e9153, type: 3}
  - id: vo_13_economy
    text: This whole time, Andreas has powered your entire local economy! So collaborative!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8edb22b9edd797f47a726764b96872cd, type: 3}
  - id: vo_14_play_more
    text: Want to play more? Try to figure out who owns the donkey if Farmer Brown never returns the wheelbarrow. Or if Andreas retires.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 16af4816b48f72c47ac7be071b14bd1c, type: 3}
  voice: {fileID: 1758374341}
